            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-blue-600 bg-blue-50/80 border border-blue-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-bold">9 Brands</span>
          </h4>
          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs">
            {reviewArticles.map(ap => (
